|               |   Filter: CAST(partition_pruning_cast_partitioned.k AS Int64) = Int64(1)                                                                              |
|               |     TableScan: partition_pruning_cast_partitioned, partial_filters=[CAST(partition_pruning_cast_partitioned.k AS Int64) = Int64(1)]                   |
|               | ]]                                                                                                                                                    |
| physical_plan | CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                       |
|               |   MergeScanExec: REDACTED
|               |                                                                                                                                                       |
+---------------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+

